CHAPTER.VERS:
Ask

          {+}
         now, and see whether a man travails with child: why do I see every [able-bodied] man with his hands on his loins, as a woman in travail, and all faces have turned pale?

And you

          {+}
         will be my people, and I will be your

          {+}
         God.

The fierce anger of Yahweh will not return, until he has executed, and until he has performed the intents of his heart: in the latter days you

          {+}
         will understand it.
